---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import PageTitle from '../components/PageTitle.astro';
import Contours from '../components/Contours.astro';
import Timeline from '../components/Timeline.astro';
import { education, experience, coursework } from '../data/profile';
---
<Layout title="About" description="Akaash Bella’s background in computer science and innovation management, graduate research and teaching at Oregon State University, and interdisciplinary project experience.">
  <PageTitle number="03" label="Background & perspective" title="An engineer’s curiosity. A human point of view." intro="I’m Akaash Bella, a computer science graduate student and researcher at Oregon State University, based in Portland, Oregon." />
  <section class="wrap about-intro"><div class="prose"><h2>Two disciplines,<br /><em>one working practice.</em></h2><p>My undergraduate study combined computer science with innovation management and a minor in business. That combination keeps the implementation question close to the people and organizations who will use the result.</p><p>In AgBizLogic, our team explored how growers make sense of software and AI assistance. In Mauka Energy, I helped connect a technical opportunity with commercialization choices. My current graduate work looks inward at the behavior of CNNs under controlled weight perturbation.</p><p>Teaching adds another useful test: can an engineering idea be explained clearly enough for someone else to reason with it? I bring that question into code review, course design, and my own project documentation.</p></div><figure class="about-map"><Contours /><figcaption class="meta">Portland ↔ Corvallis<br />An Oregon working context<br />Illustrative contour study</figcaption></figure></section>
  <section class="chapter wrap"><div class="section-heading"><div><p class="eyebrow">Experience / Research & teaching</p><h2>Learning by explaining.</h2></div><a class="text-link" href="/resume/">Read the full resume →</a></div>{experience.map(role=><article class="experience-row"><div><span class="meta">{role.period}</span><h3>{role.title}</h3><p class="caption">{role.organization}</p></div><ul>{role.points.map(point=><li>{point}</li>)}</ul></article>)}</section>
  <section class="chapter wrap education-section"><div><p class="eyebrow">Education / Oregon State University</p><h2>A foundation<br />across disciplines.</h2><p>Corvallis, Oregon<br /><span class="caption">Undergraduate study: September 2021–December 2025</span></p></div><div>{education.map(item=><div class="degree"><h3>{item.degree}</h3><p class="meta">{item.date}</p></div>)}<p class="caption">Minor in Business</p></div></section>
  <section class="chapter wrap"><p class="eyebrow">A working timeline</p><h2>From study to practice.</h2><Timeline /></section>
  <section class="chapter wrap coursework"><div><p class="eyebrow">Coursework & recognition</p><h2>Ways of thinking.</h2></div><div>{coursework.map(group=><section><h3>{group.title}</h3><p>{group.courses}</p></section>)}<h3>Recognition</h3><p>Six-time Dean’s List recipient at Oregon State University. State Retail Champion at the Oregon DECA State Career Development Conference, Sunset High School.</p></div></section>
  <section class="closing compact wrap"><p class="eyebrow">Continuing the conversation</p><h2>Questions are<br />a good <em>starting point.</em></h2><div><p>Explore the work behind this background or send a note about research, engineering, and possible collaboration.</p><a class="button" href="/contact/">Contact Akaash ↗</a></div></section>
</Layout>
